Leveling up my usual morning latte with homemade Apple Syrup! 🍎

I used Quebec Cortland apples which are incredibly juicy with a great sweet-tart balance. This made a vibrant, flavourful syrup that cuts through the richness of the espresso without making it too sweet. You don’t have to wait till autumn to make this. Quebec apples are available at the grocery store all year long.

